## BLOCKED-ON-OWNER (reported, not coded around)

- getDocumentVersionDiff (m1.ts) returns {v1Ref, v2Ref} but type Diff requires
  additions:Int!/deletions:Int!/content:String! → non-null error on every call.
  Real fix needs S3 read grant for ResolverM1Fn (new IAM) + content-format
  decision. Recorded as a second BLOCKED-ON-OWNER box under Task 26.

