Process errors during validation, reported per doctrine: (1) architect's first
listCalibrationsDue invoke used arg name withinDays (schema: windowDays) —
invocation error, not a code bug; (2) the resolvers↔migrations audit agent
called createCorrectiveAction's SQL "column-correct" — it was not (nonconformity_id);
caught during independent re-verification of the agent's findings; (3) a shell
quoting bug produced 3 failed M5 invokes before the successful matrix above.

